OL,3,ASeven killed and 23 missing after boat
OL,4,Acapsizes off northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have died after a
OL,7,Fpassenger boat capsized near northern
OL,8,FCyprus
OL,10,FSearch and rescue operations are under
OL,11,Fway to find 23 people missing, says
OL,12,FUnal Ustel, prime minister of the
OL,13,Fself-declared Turkish Republic of
OL,14,FNorthern Cyprus
OL,16,FHe says 267 people were on board the
OL,17,Fvessel when it capsized, and 237 have
OL,18,Fbeen rescued
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
